# Zebra printer registry for the optional ZPL-Studio server.
#
# `name`, `ip` (or `host`) and `port` are required. `id` is optional; when it
# is omitted, `name` becomes the API printerId. `default` is optional too.
# The optional legacy columns mndt, info, dpi and peel are accepted too, so a
# pre-existing printer registry can normally be copied here unchanged.
mndt;name;ip;port;info;dpi;peel;default
100;WARENAUSGANG;192.0.2.10;9100;Warenausgang;300;true;true
100;TESTDRUCKER;127.0.0.1;9100;Testdrucker;300;false;false
